from pathlib import Path
root=Path('/workspace/zyx/docs/apps/docs/content/docs')
for lang in ['zh','en']:
 p=root/lang/'zyx/architecture/native-single-file-storage-plan.mdx'
 text='''\n冷模式 owner 删除的原协调器准备见 `20261023-core-cost-cold-owner-deletion/`。私有候选入口接入既有实际 Entity／邻接／LabelSet 删除规划：按原 membership 合并被删 owner 的全部热字段删除，最多保留 64 个完整列计划，而不是同时保留 4096 份计划；降级时把所有幸存成员并入完整冷根，被删 owner 只移除实际存在的冷根。先完成同批热成员／冷根删除，再改变存活位；遗漏任何实际字段删除、重复 owner、错误 namespace 或跨组源都拒绝，不通过清位隐藏遗漏。存活组同步 membership.live；最后 owner 删除同时移除 membership／group 记录及 GroupDirectory 条目，包括无属性组和发生过目录搬迁的组。该准备仍无物理写入，公开冷发布 guard 保留，新 owner／pending liveness 和实际原子安装未因此验收。\n\n实际唯一约束支持树还复现了另一处独立的旧值读取缺口：生成 canonical 约束键仍经单独 ROW 入口读取，导致冷字段重复值被误报为 stale support，并让 owner 删除漏掉支持键删除。现已统一使用同一已认证 ReadContext，仅实际普通 ROW owner 回退 ROW store。保留修复前 50 项中的 1 项失败（包含两条独立断言），修复后验证真实重复键拒绝及非零支持树删除准备；源支持树／Entity／文件／根保持不变。测试还覆盖 Node 整列降级与 64-owner 最后组、实际 Edge64 且 Node64 不存在、未删除 owner 的值、保留热列、原有 8193 字节冷载体、额度失败退款／重试。结果／身份见归档；不是已公开转换数据的生命周期验收。进度仍 90%，没有全量单测、性能矩阵、提交或推送。\n''' if lang=='zh' else '''\nOriginal-coordinator cold owner-deletion preparation is recorded in `20261023-core-cost-cold-owner-deletion/`. The private candidate entry uses existing actual Entity/adjacency/LabelSet deletion planning. Fold every deleted owner's hot-field removal per original membership, retaining at most64 complete column plans rather than4096 simultaneous plans; demotion migrates all surviving members into complete cold roots and deleted owners remove only actual existing roots. Change liveness only after hot memberships and cold roots have been removed in the same private images. Missing actual removals, duplicate owners, wrong namespaces and cross-group sources refuse rather than hiding omissions by clearing bits. Surviving groups synchronize membership.live; deleting the last owner removes membership/group records and the GroupDirectory entry, including propertyless and relocated groups. Preparation still performs no physical writes and keeps public cold guards closed; pending/new owners and actual atomic installation are not accepted by this step.\n\nActual uniqueness support trees reproduced an independent old-value gap: canonical constraint keys still used a separate ROW reader, misreporting duplicate cold values as stale support and omitting support-key deletion when deleting an owner. Use the same authenticated ReadContext, falling back to the ROW store only for actual ordinary ROW owners. Preserve the pre-fix50-case report with one failing case/two independent assertions; fixed tests reject actual duplicate keys and prepare nonzero support-tree deletion, leaving source support trees/Entity/file/roots unchanged. Tests also cover Node demotion and64-owner final groups, actual Edge64 without Node64, retained owners' values/hot columns, an existing8193-byte cold carrier, quota refunds and retry. See archive for results/identity. This is not lifecycle acceptance on publicly converted data. Progress90%, no full suite, timing matrix, commit or push.\n'''
 s=p.read_text();assert '20261023-core-cost-cold-owner-deletion/' not in s;p.write_text(s+text)
 p=root/lang/'zyx/architecture/optimization.mdx';s=p.read_text()
 old='整列降级及逆转换准备与证据' if lang=='zh' else 'whole-column demotion and inverse preparation/evidence'
 new='整列降级、逆转换及 owner 删除准备与证据' if lang=='zh' else 'whole-column demotion, inverse and owner-deletion preparation/evidence'
 assert old in s;s=s.replace(old,new);p.write_text(s)
 p=root/lang/'zyx/architecture/native-capability-acceptance-matrix.mdx';s=p.read_text();s+= ('\n冷 owner 删除／最后组清理与真实唯一约束源：见 `20261023-core-cost-cold-owner-deletion/`。原协调器零写入准备覆盖实际 Entity、字段／存活位／目录及支持树；公开安装、pending／new owner 和 P7 尚未验收，进度 90%。\n' if lang=='zh' else '\nCold owner deletion/final-group cleanup and actual uniqueness sources: `20261023-core-cost-cold-owner-deletion/` covers original-coordinator zero-write preparation of actual Entity, fields/liveness/directories and support trees. Public installation, pending/new owners and P7 remain unaccepted; progress90%.\n');p.write_text(s)
